<title>USA: New Jersey EFA, won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>New Jersey EFA, won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said it won $19.280 million of New Jersey Educational Facilities Authority, the Richard Stockton College of New Jersey issue, Series 1996 F, with a true interest cost of 5.493 percent.</p>
</text>
